{"n": 1276, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1276.webp", "text": "65-812\n\n¥\nA;\n\nlelf\n\n6581060 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nAIR TEMPERATURE SENSOR\n\na) Before 9/85:\nThe air temperature sensor is located in the\nair inlet operting of the front spoiler.\n\nPress out temperature sensor with a bent 8 mm\nting wrench,\n\nPull plug out of holder and disconnect it.\n{The lower trim panel has been removed for\nbetter illustration, but this is not necessary to\nremove the temperature sensor.)\n\nChecking:\nCheck temperature sensor by measuring the\nresistance®\n\n* See Specifications\n\nb) Since 9/85:\nUnscrew screws of front spoiler in front wheel\nhouse on left and right sides.\n\nUnscrew screws.\n\nTake off spoiler.\n\nDisconnect plug on temperature sensor (1)\nPull out temperature sensor\n\nNote:\nTemperature sensor (1) is located approx. 2 cm\n(3/4**) below the left mounting screw.", "words": [["65-812", 0.4676, 0.0232, 0.5461, 0.0471], ["¥", 0.5339, 0.0882, 0.5375, 0.0962], ["A;", 0.5309, 0.0988, 0.5481, 0.1187], ["lelf", 0.5132, 0.1233, 0.5735, 0.1565], ["6581060", 0.2629, 0.0683, 0.3126, 0.0789], ["REMOVING", 0.3262, 0.0683, 0.386, 0.0796], ["AND", 0.3901, 0.069, 0.4144, 0.0796], ["INSTALLING", 0.4184, 0.069, 0.4863, 0.0796], ["AIR", 0.3257, 0.0849, 0.345, 0.0955], ["TEMPERATURE", 0.3495, 0.0849, 0.4321, 0.0981], ["SENSOR", 0.4362, 0.0849, 0.4792, 0.0955], ["a)", 0.2624, 0.1167, 0.271, 0.1286], ["Before", 0.2756, 0.1167, 0.307, 0.1273], ["9/85:", 0.3105, 0.1167, 0.3364, 0.1273], ["The", 0.2634, 0.1326, 0.2812, 0.1432], ["air", 0.2847, 0.1359, 0.2964, 0.1432], ["temperature", 0.3004, 0.1346, 0.3587, 0.1459], ["sensor", 0.3622, 0.1353, 0.3916, 0.1432], ["is", 0.3956, 0.1366, 0.4022, 0.1432], ["located", 0.4063, 0.1333, 0.4402, 0.1439], ["in", 0.4438, 0.1366, 0.4519, 0.1432], ["the", 0.4559, 0.134, 0.4711, 0.1432], ["air", 0.2629, 0.1512, 0.2751, 0.1592], ["inlet", 0.2786, 0.1492, 0.2999, 0.1592], ["operting", 0.3034, 0.1485, 0.3414, 0.1618], ["of", 0.345, 0.1485, 0.354